# <type>[optional scope]: <description>
# |<----  Limit to 50 characters  ---->|

# Explain why this change is being made
# |<----   Wrap at 72 characters   ---->|

# Provide links to relevant issues
# Closes #
# Fixes #
# Refs #

# --- COMMIT END ---
# Type can be:
#   feat     (new feature)
#   fix      (bug fix)
#   docs     (documentation)
#   test     (tests)
#   refactor (refactoring)
#   perf     (performance)
#   chore    (build/dependencies)
# --------------------
# Scopes (NAILS-specific):
#   activate, deactivate, emergency, status  (commands)
#   state, overlay, nixos, config            (modules)
#   test, docs, ci                           (development)
# --------------------
# Remember:
#   - Use imperative mood ("add" not "added")
#   - Don't end subject with period
#   - Separate subject from body with blank line
# --------------------
# Examples:
#   feat(activate): add lazy build pattern
#   fix(emergency): prevent double-mount error
#   test(state): add property-based validation
